\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9.1}{\ignorespaces Weights on past squared returns. A 22-day historical window gives each day the same weight and then drops it abruptly. EWMA gives the most weight to yesterday and fades older days gradually, so it reacts faster to news and never drops a day all at once.}}{113}{figure.caption.28}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:10-ewma}{{9.1}{113}{Weights on past squared returns. A 22-day historical window gives each day the same weight and then drops it abruptly. EWMA gives the most weight to yesterday and fades older days gradually, so it reacts faster to news and never drops a day all at once}{figure.caption.28}{}}
