\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9.3}{\ignorespaces Two robust loss functions, measured from their minimum. MSE treats a forecast that is too high and one that is too low symmetrically. QLIKE punishes a forecast that is too low far more than one that is too high: underestimating risk is the costlier mistake.}}{117}{figure.caption.30}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:10-qlike}{{9.3}{117}{Two robust loss functions, measured from their minimum. MSE treats a forecast that is too high and one that is too low symmetrically. QLIKE punishes a forecast that is too low far more than one that is too high: underestimating risk is the costlier mistake}{figure.caption.30}{}}
